<title>THAILAND: Advance Agro to issue unsecured debentures.</title>
<headline>Advance Agro to issue unsecured debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai paper firm, Advance Agro said on Wednesday it will issue unsecured debentures worth up to two billion baht ($76.9 million) in the domestic market.</p>
<p>The debentures will have a maturity of between three to seven years and carry a coupon rate at the market level, Advance Agro said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to expand its business, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
